Cell["\<\
Here I define the grid. The first entry is for the number relative to the \
subdomain,2nd entry is the u-point, 3rd and 4th are for the x and y point. \
The outpout is the triplet that represent the point in the grid.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.939200233983522*^9, 
  3.93920032748892*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d37f2cbc-1f26-4d21-96af-\
af70c211f71a"],

